rm":"아파트","zh":"公寓","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3","entryId":"29610","definition":"为使多家住户可以独立地居住在同一栋高大的建筑物内而建造的住宅。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"04eefef51a9a1ed5","term":"엘리베이터","zh":"电梯，升降梯","audio":"/audio/04eefef51a9a1ed54ff1.mp3","entryId":"70973","definition":"利用动力，装载并运送人或行李上下楼的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a1a759c684921a8d","term":"고장","zh":"故障","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3","entryId":"18856","definition":"机器或装置等不能正常运行。","pronunciation":["고ː장"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8df047791a5b5b8a39c2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30355-2-9-2","ko":"관리 사무실에 연락해서 고쳐 달라고 하세요.","zh":"请联系管理办公室，让他们来修理。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"관리","meaning":"管理","explanation":"관리：管理。","readings":[{"term":"관리","audio":"/audio/29ae8f308ff1d9963b4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30355","senseId":"2","lemma":"관리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관리","audio":"/audio/29ae8f308ff1d9963b4d.mp3"}},{"text":"사무실에","meaning":"办公室","explanation":"사무실：办公室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61202","senseId":"1","lemma":"사무실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사무실에","audio":"/audio/2a2702038caabbddf12f.mp3"}},{"text":"연락해서","meaning":"联系，联络","explanation":"연락하다：联系，联络；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"연락하다","audio":"/audio/10d47da564fecc9ebe33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62362","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락해서","audio":"/audio/224e194ec86449191b20.mp3"}},{"text":"고쳐","meaning":"修补，维修","explanation":"고치다：修补，维修；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"1","lemma":"고치다","origin":"